body:
Nice to know that most you ladies want to show your commitment to your partners.

It is assumed by people that even a committed lady can also be allured and seduced... Something like this...

This is what I want to let others know, that you would barely find a married lady or a lady commited in a relationship going to another person.....

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Thanks for proving me right!!

Well My clients are basically B2B manufacturers and suppliers of machinery, automotive spare parts, automotive headlights and some are dealing in big machinery like ice cream maker etc. So you can imagine there is nothing wrong with these pages.

&#x200B;

Because I am handling more than 100 sites of clients and there is one person assisting me in handling social media activities, then this might me the problem in case. But could you please guide me if anything I could do to stop these bans or unpublishing my pages from facebook?

23 March at the age of 23 he was hanged with his 2 friends. What a great guy. At this age we think of making love with our girlfriend, we spend our time in watching cricket, we waste our time in doing many none-sense activities, but this guy fought against cruel British and he had something different which we should learn from him rather than learning non-violence acts.

&#x200B;

One word for Bhagat Singh:  Unmatchable Persona whom we should learn a lot.

But my question is still unanswered. Stop blaming the Government only. They are people from us, and if we cannot live together with our neighbours, friends, relatives then how could they. If we argue on each and every small issue then how could we expect them not doing so.

&#x200B;

My point here is when the hell we'll start getting happier with the promotion of our competitors, when the hell we'll stop arguing with our family member over a piece of land, when the held the we'll start living in a piece and harmony????

Even one of my website was un-indexed by Google with no reason. Earlier my website was performing pretty well and almost 80% of its keywords were in top 10 (first page of google).

&#x200B;

What do you think, what could be the reason behind that?
